    ========================================================================

                   A Stack-Based Programming Language __VERSION__

                         Compiles to Native via LLVM

    ========================================================================


       "The stack is all you need."


       EXAMPLE:
       --------
       fn factorial(n:i64 -- result:i64) {
           n 1 <= if { 1 } else { n n 1 - factorial * }
       }

       fn main() {
           10 factorial print nl    // prints 3628800
       }


    ========================================================================

       TO BUILD:
         tar xzf SOURCE.TGZ
         cd quadrate
         make release
         make install

       REQUIRES:
         - C++20 compiler (GCC 10+ / Clang 10+)
         - LLVM 14+
         - Meson build system

